{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tales of Mist</strong> is a survival game blending strategy and adventure in a world consumed by decay and fog. Haunted by twisted fairy tale creatures and ruled by the tyranny of witches, you must take command of a fragile settlement and lead its people toward the light. This game with detailed pixel art aesthetics will lead you into a universe where the spirit of its inhabitants is as failing as the environment they inhabit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/c7dceaef0e26a0bbb46a6e7137c20ab0.poster.avif?t=1762289989\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/c7dceaef0e26a0bbb46a6e7137c20ab0.webm?t=1762289989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build and Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather scarce resources, expand your village, and ensure your citizens survive hunger, fear, and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/42947f07c018af082827f0ae16f349a4.poster.avif?t=1762289989\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/42947f07c018af082827f0ae16f349a4.webm?t=1762289989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Command and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Train soldiers and rally heroes to stand against covens of witches and the horrors lurking in the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/86347dfa118ecbff8839d9e11c840312.poster.avif?t=1762289989\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/86347dfa118ecbff8839d9e11c840312.webm?t=1762289989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore and Uncover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Send expeditions into the unknown, uncover hidden secrets, and confront the forces that shroud the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/af82b2f23550f412cf4a7481e319e732.poster.avif?t=1762289989\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488880/extras/af82b2f23550f412cf4a7481e319e732.webm?t=1762289989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A Unique Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive into detailed pixel art aesthetics that bring to life a dark, mechanical, and oppressive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Will you bring back the light\u2026 or witness the world be consumed by The Mist?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: ce